<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφειδ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be unsparing, lavish of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					980
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.43
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφῶν αὐτῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					2.25
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφειδήσαντες
			[πόνου,</span> or the like ] <i>ungrudgingly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				37
			</span></i>; <i>recklessly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1354
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>take no care for, neglect,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τις τοῦδ᾽ ἀφειδήσοι πόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					414
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.); <i>reck not of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαινομένης θαλάσσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Musae.
					303
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλῆος, ἀέθλων, τοκήων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.98
				</span></i>
			 (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκήδησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choerob.
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				869
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.630
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					8.217
				</span></i>
			: also in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.6
			</span></i>.</div>
